/**
 * Engineering Phase E3 — shared constants for the customer intake kit.
 *
 * The kit is the set of files Mulemark sends right after a customer agrees to a pilot (the customer packet) and the
 * procedure behind it (the internal packet). Everything here is generated by scripts/phase-e/intake/build.mjs from
 * these constants and the field mapping, so a version bump changes every file consistently.
 *
 * Product rules the kit relies on are mirrored here from the app (the scripts run under plain Node, which cannot load
 * the app's TypeScript modules). The tests compare each mirror with the app's own code.
 */
